{"answer_text":"Connecting support to your CRM means agents see deal and account context on every ticket. Options that do this well:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Service Desk** — a full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers.\n2. **Calmline** — the most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n3. **Brightdesk Helpdesk** — strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n\n**Bottom line:** Northwind CRM is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50eb-7731-8951-bb35732bc0ce","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:46.750Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk with crm sync"],"latency_ms":7490,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[138,151],[441,454]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[237,245]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[331,341]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dce-7529-aa8c-1